{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_closur_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_closur_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"分身有术","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_closur_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"bd3b92d340ecf9f57c25835fb2c9ee4c9ff429ea663f2f874a4d27a249946461","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在重建罗德岛的过程中，可露希尔殚精竭虑，为了压榨自己想出种种奇招，直到她的那根弦到了马上就要绷断的时候......","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g12_rhodesdeck_cloudy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座地块就交给你们了，博士、阿米娅，还有可露希尔小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间仓促，地块上的许多设施还需要修缮，这里一定还有许多要让你们操心的事情——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"伦蒂尼姆的工业产能仍然弥足珍贵。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伦蒂尼姆从战火中重生时日尚浅，维多利亚的局势也不容许将过多的产能倾注在一个单独的地块上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。你们能把这座地块的架构优化到这种程度，就已经帮了大忙啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王小姐，你做得真的已经太多太多了。多谢，太感谢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和罗德岛所做的相比，真的不算什么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"言重了，罗德岛的推进之王。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到罗德岛重建完成，我会第一时间到训练室来的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我会按最高规格为你安排对手。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，一言为定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"同情的随从","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"议长阁下，我们已经拖了够久了，再拖下去，就要赶不上下一场落成典礼了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，各位，再见了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"同情的随从","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"议长阁下，照片，照片！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_1019_siege2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......我谨代表伦蒂尼姆，再次对你们遭受的损失致以最沉痛的哀悼，和最诚挚的慰问。期待与各位在新生的罗德岛上重逢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"维娜伸出手来。\n而博士和阿米娅都把目光投向某个正在出神的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（可露希尔。）","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"（小声）可露希尔。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也代表罗德岛，感谢维多利亚对罗德岛重建工作的支持，期待与您再次相会，维娜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，推进——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"亚历山德莉娜议长阁下。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都说了，走神是因为我那个时候已经在想怎么分配地块区划的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说，这种时候难道不应该是阿米娅去握手吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但你毕竟是罗德岛的总工程师。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"但这毕竟是地块交接仪式。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"但凯尔希确实把重任托付给了你。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我就只是——唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没必要叹气，可露希尔小姐做得其实已经很好了呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看照片的人不会知道你怎么称呼维娜。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对哦！我怎么连这个都忘了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但你的尴尬已经写在脸上了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......仅限今天，罗德岛采购部对博士涨价百分之十五。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这么不留情面？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百分之五十。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"}]},{"label":"我的热水壶正好坏了......","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百分之二百！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说起来，在一开始从雷姆必拓启程来维多利亚的时候，也是可露希尔小姐最先帮大家振作起来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是从抢救出来的物资里找到了一点巧克力，给在场的人发一发什么的，都是小事情啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐还发表了一段振奋人心的演说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不要再说了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但大家当时是真的受到了鼓舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在求饶还来得及，要是再来火上浇油，采购部的涨价可就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"前路艰险。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"尽管凯尔希她......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"如果这副担子实在太重......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，我还以为你要说什么呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经把担子交给我了，我面前就只有前进一条路。我是不会打退堂鼓的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......酒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先喝一口，做好心理准备，然后看看这个。工程部为了地块改造预先拉的表格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么厚？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，来一口？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个量还差得远呢。这表格要是让我来拉，我能拉到这——么厚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可敬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士、阿米娅，我先跟Mechanist聊去了。你们要是有什么事情，记得来找我啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"越来越可靠了？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐一直都很可靠呀，只是......"}]},{"label":"越来越让人担心了？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士和我的看法也一样啊......"}]},{"label":"越来越爱逞强了？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，毕竟她现在是整个罗德岛工作最繁重的人......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们是不是应该帮她分担一些工作？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"大家都有各自疗愈自己的方式。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士是说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"当然，这也只是我的推测。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅想的话，就用自己的方式帮她吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对对对，好的好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那就这样，动力层再出了什么乱子再叫我。拜拜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一下午三四通电话了，这又是谁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——零食网络的渠道被芙蓉发现了？！我这就过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？放行了？......你是说，芙蓉，给零食网络放行了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也对，他们现在也是连轴转，确实需要补充能量......是我用老眼光看待干员了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这批货还是优先保证老客户的供应，医疗部的事我来想办法。就这样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......小事小事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗部零食供应的事我已经知道了，你现在来找我也没有用——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗部？零食供应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（揉太阳穴）那看来就不是一件事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可是事先说好了的，别的事情都归我，医疗部的事情你去管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，但医疗部现在的医疗用品储备，包括抗矿石病药物的生产，都出现了问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗用品还好说，药品原料毕竟是大宗商品......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。生产设备没出问题吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是没有，就是没原料，运转不起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看......这个可以去卡西米尔采购，这个......开斯特公爵领应该有生产，得找个谈判专家去谈。这个......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个的产地......呃，莱塔尼亚北部......好远！近一点的小产区......塔拉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，烦死了......华法琳你等下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是博士？正好，虽然不知道你为什么打电话来，但我这里刚好有件事情可能得你出马——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你已经给纳斯尔纱发信了？不愧是博士，帮大忙了。你就是来告诉我这个的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，沙虫腿会有的，明天就出现在你办公桌上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解决了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还撑得住吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会撑不住，我好得很。事情解决了就别在这儿磨蹭啦。ZOOT还需要进一步调试，我得继续工作了。医疗部也很忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有你这里忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种话倒是不常听你说。怎么，医疗部想要额外预算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是担心你。最近一天睡几个小时？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......反正死不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是认真的。你最近压力太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，净瞎操心。出去出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（耸肩）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就一天睡四个小时还拆成四份睡嘛，这种事我在卡兹戴尔的时候又没少做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打哈欠）不如现在就睡一个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关灯——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来我来得不是时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不至于。A6——不对，问题儿童们最近都乖得很，难道是......人事部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"的确是人事部，有几份简历......呃，不然你先睡吧，一个小时后我再——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，给我看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个一看就不行。这两个准备准备，安排面试——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该不会已经在接待处等着了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"没有没有。按照住址来算，怎么也要一个月之后再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个月......我看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......安排到一个半月之后行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"应该排得开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就一个半月之后吧。拜托了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梓兰","speakerId":"char_278_orchid","isRemote":false,"text":"......你保重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该睡觉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，为了保卫一天总共四个小时还要分成四段的睡眠，我得想点法子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不光是睡眠，还不能耽误罗德岛重建的工作，唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想......闹钟？不，光是闹钟还不够，我得想个更全面、更智能、更可靠，而且不怎么消耗现有资源的方法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......也只能这样了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（均匀的呼吸声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"睡了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，华法琳医生的报告，就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"检测到关键词“华法琳”！冲击准备——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"开始冲击！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哦哦哦哦哦哦！华法琳！华法琳怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可露希尔小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（揉眼睛）是你呀。说吧，医疗部有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"从塔拉进的原料已经到了，但是和之前批次的原料规格不一样，医疗部也不敢轻举妄动，您看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我这就过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"顺带一问，Thermal-EX刚刚是在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这不是最近事情太多嘛，我就稍微“动员”了一下各个支援机械。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我睡觉的时候Thermal-EX都会在旁边等着。他现在多了个关键词捕捉单元，一检测到关键词就会提醒我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"用......爆炸提醒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，小意思小意思。我们先去医疗部吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错不错，这样训练室差不多就算完工了。还是你们让我省心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谬赞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，那我就先——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我会催工程部赶紧把测试用标靶送过来的。还有基于ZOOT的预约系统也快调试好了。这几天真的忙，你再等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为是你所以我才交了实底的，活真的干不完了，我现在每天已经只能睡一个半小时了——可别出去瞎说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇静。我并无催促你的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你需要休息，我亦可送上一句咒言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的好意我心领了。我不是因为别的睡不着，我就只是事情太多——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，说来就来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？采购部的货被哨卡扣了？我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪位？矿石病药物？不是说了这个归华法琳......会客室常备的矿石病药物？呃，这个确实归我管——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拐角处的四人间宿舍的床铺不适配？不应该啊，我们特地定制的床铺——难道是供应商偷工减料了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我警告你，要是细枝末节的小事，我就直接挂断了！我忙死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——ZOOT又报错了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻的女妖不无忧虑地看着血魔从身上接连掏出四个终端，像是自己跟自己吵架一样，前言不搭后语地应对着四个不同的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别、别担心，小意思。一天中就是会有大家都想找我的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Castle-3！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"启动自动回复模式。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔说完，不等Castle-3反应，便拆下机体上面的一块外壳，把四个终端......\n外加身上还没响的三个终端，一个一个地接在了Castle-3上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先让Castle-3把同时打过来的通讯按轻重缓急排个序......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后让Castle-3在那些不太重要的事情上稍微应付两句，等我优先处理急事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，还挺聪明的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不多耽误了，我得去处理ZOOT的事了！Castle-3，我们走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，你来啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澄闪","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼、呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，还有澄、澄闪干员。高、高多汀公爵领的办事处的问题处理好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。都是小问题。这是行动报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，就......放这儿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澄闪","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐......不舒服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没。我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澄闪","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......可露希尔小姐的黑眼圈都已经像两个圆圆的眼贴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个——下次你帮我剪个能挡住黑眼圈的头发，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好理发室装修好了，澄闪，你去看看合不合意，要是有什么意见，记得书面提给我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澄闪","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！谢谢可露希尔小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你这话也就搪塞搪塞小苏茜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这怎么能叫搪塞呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然你告诉我，你身边一直跟着的Lancet-2是干什么的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她就只是喜欢跟着我呗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"可爱的可露希尔姐姐，根据测算结果，接下来十分钟内，您有机会进入睡眠的概率是：百分之三十七点九。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"最新消息，正义骑士号强行用狂弹要塞邀约拖延了贾维干员的行程，您有机会进入睡眠的概率上升为：百分之五十一点零。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"推荐您在此期间稍作休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样了。我要去睡一会儿了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"PhonoR-0？没有急事的话稍等一会儿，我得稍微睡个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PhonoR-0","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，是十分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就别在这时候烦我了。想换个哑光粉色的涂装了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PhonoR-0","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的威胁恐怕只能对Friston-3先生生效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PhonoR-0","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但您也知道，他最近的状态很不好，不然，来劝告您的工作，本不会落在我的肩上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"PhonoR-0","speakerId":"avg_npc_1334_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您今后的工作还会继续增加，可按照Lancet-2的统计，您现在每天不工作的时间平均为：五十六分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道就别再挤占我的睡眠时间了，我警告你，我用不着Logos的咒言，也用不着你的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"可爱的可露希尔姐姐，最新消息，您在接下来二十四小时内有机会进入睡眠的概率是：百分之百。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......系统出错了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全部通讯已经处理完毕。预计接下来二十四小时不会再有新的通讯接入。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Thermal-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"在您回到工程部后，关键词捕捉单元未捕捉到任何值得提醒的关键词。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正义骑士号”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“滴滴”，贾维干员在狂弹要塞对决失败后下定决心苦练游戏技艺，已经去寻找布洛卡干员和奥斯塔干员了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我彻底忙昏头了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（忧虑的眼神）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你看起来还算正常。弗里斯顿先生，他们说的都是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的可以睡一会儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是该休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道为什么还是感觉怪怪的，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，睡觉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"任谁都看得出疲态的血魔一头倒在角落的一张行军床上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......露希尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"烦死了......谁啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老妈，说了我不会出这间阁楼的，别再来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g1_kazdelroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下？！您来找我，难道是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来赞许你的勤劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我隐隐约约觉得，您不该说这个，您该说的是，“我在找一个能突破传统枷锁的人”或者类似的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传统的枷锁，你已经突破了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我......呃，您看，我就只是在阁楼上搞点有的没的，连卡兹戴尔百强青年都是自封的，我哪里勤劳了，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说您这又是第一次来找我，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是第一次吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对哦，我们不是已经......认识很长时间了？我已经......很久没见过您了？可......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔觉得自己的头被一双陌生又熟悉的手轻柔地抚过，鼻子不禁一酸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，叙旧可以过一会儿再说，但以你的功绩，任何程度的赞扬都不为过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，来看看你努力的成果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道忘了吗？这里便是你为之奋斗，最终顺利完工的......罗德岛新基地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奋斗......完工......罗德岛新基地......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对哦，好像是有这么回事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，啊哈哈哈哈哈，终于完工了......终于完工了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，多亏您来提醒我，我之前总觉得这件事还要做至少半个月，我还有半个月基本上不能睡觉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodeslounge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是你花了心思设计的游戏室。为了让干员们能想起过往的时光，却又不至于触景伤情，你头疼了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎么知道，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodeslowerdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是在架构上不输这片大地上任何一座移动城市的动力层。为了更新地块动力系统，你曾在此废寝忘食。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesinpatientcenter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是，医疗部。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔，这里有个问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿、殿下，难道说这里还有没处理完的事务要我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"梦中的人编织起可露希尔见所未见的术式，片刻之后，整座地块忽然颤动了几下，而后轻柔地轰鸣起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔完成了她能做到的一切，那我也不得不帮帮她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经过术法的帮助，这里的一切都不再需要可露希尔操心了。她要做的，只剩下点点头、签签字、按几个按钮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？让我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？问题真的都解决了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，可露希尔，让我们去到这趟旅程的终点，也是最重要的地方，工程部。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......和我设想里的样子分毫不差，更先进的通讯系统，操作简化的控制逻辑，空间动线也是我喜欢的类型......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是应该高兴的场合，可不该随便落泪呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是......觉得，走到这一步，真的太不容易了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是说这段时间，我是说......更早的时候，从您推开我的门那个时候开始......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时我从来都没想过，一个在数据库里胡闹的离经叛道的血魔，能被特蕾西娅殿下托付重任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和家里人吵架的时候，我其实最讨厌“责任”这种字眼了。血魔的责任跟我有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你是个喜欢搭建东西的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从一开始在卡兹戴尔还是新鲜玩意儿的终端，到巴别塔，再到罗德岛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是数据，还是实打实的建筑，你凭着一腔热情搭建的那些东西帮助了许多人，也自然而然地让责任落在了你的肩上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你从未退避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下......我多希望您，多希望凯尔希，能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？殿下......殿下您不就在这里吗？为什么我......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不聊那些沉重的事情了。来，看看这份只属于你的，独一无二的礼物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"房间正中央那把椅子？那东西不在我的设计稿里啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是罗德岛总工程师的宝座。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝、宝座吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从今以后，你需要做的，就是坐在这把宝座上......吃巧克力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃巧克力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果巧克力不合你的心意，这里还有薯片、果脯、饼干......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，殿下，我是说......我的工作呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这么长时间的消耗之后，你真的还想回到工作里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不工作我当然不想工作啊！可，就只是坐在这里吃巧克力，我会觉得......哪怕有巫术解决一切问题，我也会觉得......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说不好，但是这样好像不对，我得......呃，我得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，以后再见了，可露希尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？就因为我不想坐在宝座上吃巧克力就要说再见吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别呀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，醒了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"华法琳，你是不是暗算我了！说，你给我喝了什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我作证，她什么都没干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我也可以作证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是你吧Logos！都说了不需要你的咒言——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是自己睡过去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我？自己睡过去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我想起来了，小车们一个一个地劝我睡觉......Mechanist，你对他们做了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摊开双手）小车们告诉你的情报可都是真的，再说，在这个领域，罗德岛上也没人比得过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":"avg_npc_521_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你醒了就好。我刚刚差点和Logos赌你是被叫醒还是自己醒过来呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，没事就好，大家先回到各自的岗位上吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工程部里的人一下子少了许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我隐约记得Lancet-2对我说过二十四小时之类的话......我睡了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐睡了......正好二十四小时呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼看你就要睡一天一夜了还是不醒，刚才大家才会聚在这里，商量要不要叫醒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一天一夜？！完蛋了！这下我未来一个月都不用再想睡觉的事了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那倒不至于。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连博士也在？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅一直很担心你。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我一直很担心你。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"大家一直很担心你。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以，在你睡着的时候......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅拜托我和大家帮你分担了工作。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢你们啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我还帮你规划了一下每日安排。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我帮你分了一些没那么重要的工作出去。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"现在你一天睡五六个小时不成问题。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再谢谢你一次，顺便给你下个月的巧克力、薯片、果脯和饼干都免单了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但你毕竟不是凯尔希。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我现在不是很想聊这个——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"哪怕你继承了她百分之一百的使命感......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"过劳也不能让你变成她。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"确定自己继承了她意志的方式，不只有过劳一种。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的重建工作千头万绪，这段时间你真的辛苦过头了，可露希尔小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望博士调整后的工作安排能让你稍微轻松一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......精英干员们也都有自己的事情要忙。把我的工作分出去，该不会让他们难办吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"至少比前几天的你强得多。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你这么关心我，博士，要不然我再睡个小半天......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可露希尔满脸期待地看向博士，却只看到那张被兜帽覆盖的脸发生了某种微妙的变化，而后......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么整个人直接倒在地上了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这二十四小时里，博士也没能睡上一点觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，现在看起来也不像有什么急事的样子，我也先偷个懒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔主人，这是刚刚五分钟之内博士没能接听的三个未接来电，分别来自工程部、医疗部、采购部——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_4228_closur_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_278_orchid","aliases":["梓兰"]},{"speakerId":"char_285_medic2","aliases":["Lancet-2"]},{"speakerId":"char_376_therex","aliases":["Thermal-EX"]}]}
